{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"范畴化"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span></strong> (categorification) <span lang=\"zh\">在数学上有多种含义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但每种范畴化都是提升范畴层级的过程</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">所谓范畴层级大致就是指</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/n-r-范畴","text":"$(n,r)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的整数</span> $r$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">逆范畴化的反向过程</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴化是一个模糊的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">逆范畴化</span></strong> (decategorification) <span lang=\"zh\">有清晰的含义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">取对象的等价类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">得到一个集合</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">在一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">去掉高阶不可逆态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">并将高阶的等价</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">得到较低阶的范畴</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当高阶范畴具有额外的代数结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其逆范畴化仍保留相应结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">如果能将上述操作</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">反向</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">即由带结构的低阶范畴开始</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">找到一个带结构的高阶范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其逆范畴化是已知的结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则可将该过程称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span></strong>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">走向</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的内部</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有另一种范畴化的思路</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可以理解为</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">集合</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">替换为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">重新做一遍熟悉的事情</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">更准确地说即是在</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中工作</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">就是</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">那么对于普通的结合代数能够谈论的事情</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于幺半范畴基本上也能谈论</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">例如我们可以谈论幺半范畴上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它不过是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}